_XtT9K86EghsTa8A4pDBoOIZBM3VFSncVt9VNAw6DK7j_KsNPZto&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGe4RYm4_DYodyqYeH_7_vST0_wVC1UXzN7u6lCk65VtQ&oe=6A85814E"}, {"file_name": "Code_Playground_View_Pond.png", "id": "1593305657751911", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974576_1593305661085244_1368760051307669731_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pCSeuDmEdA4Q7kNvwEutmAg&_nc_oc=Adol_EtFZwrIc9XQLz9--M1bTgiEs3HzKkjHU5yKegzHDD9tL8aPnWDJOOxYNTqU6MA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEN781BuAJgLIofLllZnyVcEH6Uf5nApMD0RBRWRztI8Q&oe=6A857B61"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PVR_Cover Landscape - 2560x1440.png", "id": "429997232540328", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75361360_429997235873661_5804819608709080672_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kRwsdIbRAp8Q7kNvwFvNaP6&_nc_oc=Adp6DT0CpLCfuK1o8d4IcoKCJJhH1K-NyVeZn_v_JEbLhW5rT5g_ZTmts4YJ40WGxno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFsJ-1GBSUFWoRUKcijwA3yIeOHu0BbY5ct8CFQRaefGw&oe=6A8586C8"}, "display_name": "Programmer VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Want to learn programming in a fun way? \n\nLook no further than Programmer VR\n\nHelp Bob collect rewards by overcoming obstacles in 3 breathtaking virtual worlds.  Learn programming concepts, sharpen your logical thinking and develop problem-solving skills in an easy, fun, immersive, and enjoyable way. This game is brought to you by the developers of iB Cricket, one of the highest-rated VR games.\n\nKey features:\n- 50 levels of programming fun\n- 3 enchanting virtual worlds -  Pond, Futuristic Neon City, and Neon Pyramid\n- No previous programming knowledge is required\n- Sharpen your logical thinking skills and improve your critical thinking skills\n- Learn programming concepts like Instruction execution order,  Conditional Statements, and Loops.\n- Co-op Mode\n", "sh